/* ◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆ 【顶栏 · 仿微信】 ◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆ */
/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
   结构参考 kkt日夜 的顶栏：
   规则只挂在 div.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom 下，
   不碰 .glass-header（设定页也用它），聊天里别的地方都不动

   毛玻璃浮在聊天区上方 + 底部灰线
   返回 ‹ + 其他窗口未读数 ｜ 名字 + 听筒（居中） ｜ ···
   电话、视频两个键：看不见，但还在原位能点
   ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ */

/* --- 1. 顶栏：毛玻璃，浮在聊天区上方，底部灰线 --- */
div.chat-detail-screen {
  position: relative !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom {
  position: absolute !important;
  top: 0 !important;
  left: 0 !important;
  right: 0 !important;
  display: flex !important;
  align-items: center !important;
  box-sizing: border-box !important;
  height: var(--wx-hdr-height) !important;
  min-height: var(--wx-hdr-height) !important;
  padding: var(--wx-hdr-offset) 10px 0 0 !important;
  background: var(--wx-hdr-bg) !important;
  backdrop-filter: blur(var(--wx-hdr-blur)) saturate(1.8) !important;
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(var(--wx-hdr-blur)) saturate(1.8) !important;
  border: none !important;
  border-bottom: var(--wx-hdr-line-w) solid var(--wx-hdr-line) !important;
  border-radius: 0 !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  overflow: visible !important;
  z-index: 50 !important;
}
/* 消息列表让出顶栏高度，第一条消息不会被盖住 */
div.chat-detail-screen .chat-message-list-custom {
  padding-top: calc(var(--wx-hdr-height) + 8px) !important;
}

/* 头像、副标题不要 */
div.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom .header-avatar-container,
div.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom .chat-header-avatar,
div.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom .chat-header-subtitle {
  display: none !important;
}

/* --- 2. 名字：绝对居中，不受左右按键宽度影响 --- */
div.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom .header-profile-section {
  position: absolute !important;
  left: 52% !important;
  top: calc(50% + var(--wx-hdr-offset) / 2) !important;
  transform: translate(-50%, -50%) !important;
  display: flex !important;
  flex-direction: row !important;
  align-items: center !important;
  justify-content: center !important;
  max-width: calc(100% - 180px) !important;
  min-width: 0 !important;
  flex: none !important;
  margin: 0 !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
  text-align: center !important;
  background: none !important;
  pointer-events: auto !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom .header-profile-section::before,
div.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom .header-profile-section::after {
  content: none !important;
  display: none !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom .chat-header-title {
  display: inline-flex !important;
  align-items: center !important;
  gap: var(--wx-ear-gap) !important;
  max-width: 100% !important;
  margin: 0 !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
  font-size: var(--wx-title-size) !important;
  font-weight: 600 !important;
  line-height: 24px !important;
  color: var(--wx-ink) !important;
  white-space: nowrap !important;
  overflow: hidden !important;
  text-overflow: ellipsis !important;
  background: none !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  text-shadow: none !important;
  transform: none !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom .chat-header-title::before {
  content: none !important;
  display: none !important;
}
/* 听筒图标 */
div.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom .chat-header-title::after {
  content: "" !important;
  display: block !important;
  flex: none !important;
  width: calc(var(--wx-ear-h) * 0.73) !important;
  height: var(--wx-ear-h) !important;
  background: var(--wx-ear-icon) center / contain no-repeat !important;
  pointer-events: none !important;
}

/* --- 3. 按键通用：隐藏原图标（按钮保留） --- */
div.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom .header-btn-back > *:not(.nuo-chat-header-unread-dot):not(.nuo-chat-header-unread-num),
div.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom .header-action-btn > * {
  display: none !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom .header-btn-back,
div.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom .header-action-btn {
  flex: none !important;
  height: 40px !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
  margin: 0 !important;
  border: none !important;
  border-radius: 0 !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  backdrop-filter: none !important;
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: none !important;
  background-color: transparent !important;
  background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
  background-position: center !important;
  transform: none !important;
  opacity: 1 !important;
}

/* 排列：返回 →（空）→ 电话（隐形）→ 视频（隐形）→ ··· */
div.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom .header-btn-back  { order: 0 !important; }
div.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom .header-btn-phone { order: 1 !important; margin-left: auto !important; }
div.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom .header-btn-video { order: 2 !important; }
div.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom .header-btn-info  { order: 3 !important; }

/* --- 4. 返回：细长箭头，靠左 --- */
div.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom .header-btn-back {
  position: relative !important;   /* 未读数靠这个定位，不要删 */
  overflow: visible !important;
  width: 44px !important;
  min-width: 44px !important;
  background-image: var(--wx-back-icon) !important;
  background-size: 24px 24px !important;
  background-position: var(--wx-back-x) 50% !important;
}

/* --- 5. 其他窗口未读数：跟在箭头右边，App 实时更新 --- */
div.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom .nuo-chat-header-unread-num {
  display: inline-flex !important;
  align-items: center !important;
  justify-content: center !important;
  position: absolute !important;
  left: var(--wx-unread-x) !important;
  right: auto !important;
  top: 50% !important;
  transform: translateY(-50%) !important;
  min-width: 20px !important;
  height: 20px !important;
  padding: 0 6px !important;
  box-sizing: border-box !important;
  border-radius: 10px !important;
  background: var(--wx-unread-bg) !important;
  color: var(--wx-unread-text) !important;
  font-size: 12px !important;
  font-weight: 600 !important;
  line-height: 20px !important;
  white-space: nowrap !important;
  border: none !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  pointer-events: none !important;
  z-index: 2 !important;
}
/* 红点不要，只留数字 */
div.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom .nuo-chat-header-unread-dot {
  display: none !important;
}

/* --- 6. 电话、视频：透明但还能点 --- */
div.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom .header-btn-phone,
div.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom .header-btn-video {
  width: 32px !important;
  min-width: 32px !important;
  background-image: none !important;
  opacity: var(--wx-call-debug) !important;
}

/* --- 7. 右侧 ··· --- */
div.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom .header-btn-info {
  width: 40px !important;
  min-width: 40px !important;
  background-image: var(--wx-more-icon) !important;
  background-size: 22px 22px !important;
  background-position: calc(100% - 4px) 50% !important;
}

/* --- 8. AI 回复中：名字换成「对方正在输入中…」，听筒图标照样跟在后面
   靠的是 App 回复时出现的 .nuo-typing-indicator（三点气泡）
   三个点在下面藏掉了，元素还在，所以这里照样能认出来
   :not(#_k) 是为了压过上面标题的普通样式，不要删 --- */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):has(.nuo-typing-indicator) .chat-header-custom .chat-header-title,
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):has(.nuo-typing-indicator) .chat-header-custom .chat-header-title > * {
  font-size: 0 !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):has(.nuo-typing-indicator) .chat-header-custom .chat-header-title::before {
  content: "对方正在输入中…" !important;
  display: block !important;
  position: static !important;
  top: auto !important;
  font-size: var(--wx-title-size) !important;
  font-weight: 600 !important;
  line-height: 24px !important;
  color: var(--wx-ink) !important;
  white-space: nowrap !important;
}

/* 「对方正在输入中…」时：听筒不要，整体往右挪 --wx-typing-shift */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):has(.nuo-typing-indicator) .chat-header-custom .chat-header-title::after {
  content: none !important;
  display: none !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):has(.nuo-typing-indicator) .chat-header-custom .header-profile-section {
  transform: translate(calc(-50% + var(--wx-typing-shift)), -50%) !important;
}

/* --- 9. 三点打字气泡：整行彻底不显示、不占任何位置
   用 display: none，连外面包着它的那一行也一起藏掉，聊天区不会被往上顶
   元素还在页面里，上面顶栏「对方正在输入中…」照样认得出来
   :not(#_k) 叠三层是为了压过 App 写在行内的高度和边距，不要删 --- */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k):not(#_k) .nuo-typing-indicator,
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k):not(#_k) .chat-message-list-custom > *:has(.nuo-typing-indicator) {
  display: none !important;
  height: 0 !important;
  min-height: 0 !important;
  margin: 0 !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
  pointer-events: none !important;
}

/* ◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆ 【底栏】 ◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆ */
/* [功能键] [   可按住 转文字   (🎤)] [表情包] [AI 回复]
     ① 最左圆圈声波 → 功能键（菜单） .input-btn-plus     强制不旋转
     ② 输入框里的麦克风 → 语音       .input-btn-mic      点进输入框才显示
     ③ 笑脸           → 表情包       .input-btn-sticker
     ④ 圆圈加号       → AI 回复      .input-btn-ai
   按键原来的功能都不变，只换样子和位置
   :not(#_k):not(#_k) 只是用来抬高优先级，压住 App 自带样式 */

/* --- 1. 底栏容器：毛玻璃，往上叠在聊天区底部，消息能从后面透出来 --- */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom {
  position: relative !important;
  z-index: 40 !important;
  margin-top: calc(-1 * var(--wxb-overlap)) !important;
  padding: var(--wxb-top) var(--wxb-side) var(--wxb-bottom) !important;
  background: var(--wxb-bg) !important;
  backdrop-filter: blur(var(--wxb-blur)) saturate(1.8) !important;
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(var(--wxb-blur)) saturate(1.8) !important;
  border: none !important;
  border-top: 0.5px solid var(--wxb-line) !important;
  border-radius: 0 !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
}
/* 消息列表底部让出底栏高度，最后一条消息不会被盖住 */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .chat-message-list-custom {
  padding-bottom: calc(var(--wxb-overlap) + 8px) !important;
}

/* 中间几层不当定位基准，右边两个图标才能按底栏定位 */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom .input-row-wrapper,
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom .input-btns-right {
  position: static !important;
  background: transparent !important;
  border: none !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  backdrop-filter: none !important;
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: none !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom .input-row-wrapper {
  display: flex !important;
  align-items: flex-end !important;   /* 输入框长高时，功能键贴着最后一行 */
  gap: 0 !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom .input-btns-right {
  display: flex !important;
  align-items: center !important;
  flex: none !important;
  gap: 0 !important;
  margin: 0 0 0 auto !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
}

/* --- 2. 白色输入框 --- */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom *:has(> .input-box-custom) {
  position: static !important;
  display: flex !important;
  align-items: center !important;
  box-sizing: border-box !important;
  flex: 1 1 auto !important;
  min-width: 0 !important;
  height: var(--wxb-cap-h) !important;
  min-height: var(--wxb-cap-h) !important;
  max-height: var(--wxb-cap-h) !important;
  margin: 0 calc(var(--wxb-gap) + var(--wxb-icon) * 2 + var(--wxb-gap2)) 0 0 !important;
  padding: 0 8px 0 12px !important;
  background: var(--wxb-cap-bg) !important;
  border: none !important;
  border-radius: var(--wxb-cap-radius) !important;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 var(--wxb-cap-line-w, 0.5px) var(--wxb-cap-line, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05)) !important;
  backdrop-filter: none !important;
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: none !important;
}

div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom .input-box-custom.input-box-custom {
  flex: 1 1 auto !important;
  min-width: 0 !important;
  height: var(--wxb-line-h) !important;
  min-height: var(--wxb-line-h) !important;
  max-height: var(--wxb-line-h) !important;
  margin: 0 !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
  background: transparent !important;
  border: none !important;
  outline: none !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  font-size: var(--wxb-font) !important;
  line-height: var(--wxb-line-h) !important;
  color: var(--wxb-text) !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: var(--wxb-text) !important;
  caret-color: var(--wxb-caret) !important;
  --input-box-color: var(--wxb-text) !important;
  resize: none !important;
  overflow-y: auto !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom .input-box-custom::placeholder {
  color: transparent !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent !important;
}

/* 「可按住 转文字」：在输入框里居中，点进去或有字就消失 */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom::before {
  content: var(--wxb-placeholder) !important;
  display: block !important;
  position: absolute !important;
  left: calc(var(--wxb-side) + var(--wxb-icon) + var(--wxb-gap)) !important;
  right: calc(var(--wxb-side) + var(--wxb-icon) * 2 + var(--wxb-gap2) + var(--wxb-gap)) !important;
  top: auto !important;
  bottom: calc(var(--wxb-bottom) + (var(--wxb-cap-h) - var(--wxb-line-h)) / 2) !important;
  transform: none !important;
  font-size: var(--wxb-font) !important;
  font-weight: 400 !important;
  line-height: var(--wxb-line-h) !important;
  text-align: center !important;
  white-space: nowrap !important;
  color: var(--wxb-placeholder-color) !important;
  background: none !important;
  pointer-events: none !important;
  z-index: 1 !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom:has(.input-box-custom:focus)::before,
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom:has(.input-box-custom:not(:placeholder-shown))::before {
  display: none !important;
}

/* --- 3. 图标通用：藏掉原图标 --- */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom :is(.input-btn-plus, .input-btn-sticker, .input-btn-ai, .input-btn-mic) > *:not(.more-options-popup):not(:has(.more-options-popup)),
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom :is(.input-btn-plus, .input-btn-sticker, .input-btn-ai, .input-btn-mic) svg:not(.more-options-popup *) {
  display: none !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom :is(.input-btn-plus, .input-btn-sticker, .input-btn-ai)::before,
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom :is(.input-btn-plus, .input-btn-sticker, .input-btn-ai)::after {
  content: none !important;
  display: none !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom :is(.input-btn-plus, .input-btn-sticker, .input-btn-ai) {
  display: block !important;
  box-sizing: border-box !important;
  flex: none !important;
  width: var(--wxb-icon) !important;
  height: var(--wxb-icon) !important;
  min-width: var(--wxb-icon) !important;
  min-height: var(--wxb-icon) !important;
  max-width: var(--wxb-icon) !important;
  max-height: var(--wxb-icon) !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
  border: none !important;
  border-radius: 50% !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  opacity: 1 !important;
  visibility: visible !important;
  overflow: visible !important;
  background-color: transparent !important;
  background-position: center !important;
  background-size: 100% 100% !important;
  background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
}

/* --- 4. 功能键：最左，强制不旋转 --- */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom .input-btn-plus.input-btn-plus {
  position: relative !important;
  align-self: flex-end !important;
  margin: 0 var(--wxb-gap) calc((var(--wxb-cap-h) - var(--wxb-icon)) / 2) 0 !important;
  background-image: var(--wxb-ic-func) !important;
}
/* 菜单打开时 App 会转这个键，按钮、子元素、各种状态一起锁死 */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom .input-btn-plus.input-btn-plus,
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom .input-btn-plus.input-btn-plus *,
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom .input-btn-plus.input-btn-plus:is(:hover, :active, :focus, [class*="active"], [class*="open"], [class*="rotate"], [aria-expanded="true"]) {
  transform: none !important;
  rotate: none !important;
  transition: none !important;
  animation: none !important;
}

/* --- 5. 表情包：输入框外右侧 --- */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom .input-btn-sticker.input-btn-sticker {
  position: absolute !important;
  right: calc(var(--wxb-side) + var(--wxb-icon) + var(--wxb-gap2)) !important;
  bottom: calc(var(--wxb-bottom) + (var(--wxb-cap-h) - var(--wxb-icon)) / 2) !important;
  left: auto !important;
  top: auto !important;
  margin: 0 !important;
  transform: none !important;
  z-index: 3 !important;
  background-image: var(--wxb-ic-sticker) !important;
}

/* --- 6. AI 回复：最右 --- */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom .input-btn-ai.input-btn-ai {
  position: absolute !important;
  right: var(--wxb-side) !important;
  bottom: calc(var(--wxb-bottom) + (var(--wxb-cap-h) - var(--wxb-icon)) / 2) !important;
  left: auto !important;
  top: auto !important;
  margin: 0 !important;
  transform: none !important;
  z-index: 3 !important;
  background-image: var(--wxb-ic-ai) !important;
}

/* --- 7. 语音：输入框右侧，平时看不见（还能点），点进输入框才显示 --- */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom .input-btn-mic.input-btn-mic {
  display: block !important;
  position: relative !important;
  flex: none !important;
  align-self: flex-end !important;
  width: var(--wxb-mic) !important;
  height: var(--wxb-mic) !important;
  min-width: var(--wxb-mic) !important;
  margin: 0 0 calc((var(--wxb-line-h) - var(--wxb-mic)) / 2) 6px !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
  border: none !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  background: var(--wxb-ic-mic) center / 100% 100% no-repeat !important;
  opacity: 0.01 !important;          /* 0.01 不用 0：有些 WebView 对完全透明的元素不响应点击 */
  transform: none !important;
  z-index: 2 !important;
}
/* 只认输入框本身获得焦点，点功能键、表情包时不会误亮 */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom:has(.input-box-custom:focus) .input-btn-mic.input-btn-mic,
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom:has(.input-box-custom:not(:placeholder-shown)) .input-btn-mic.input-btn-mic {
  opacity: 1 !important;
}

/* --- 8. 发送键：平时不显示 --- */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom .send-btn-custom {
  display: none !important;
}

/* --- 9. 输入框有字时（iOS 安卓都一样）：
   AI 回复的圆圈加号 → 绿色「发送」按钮（只发消息，可以连发），表情包照样留着
   清空 → 变回圆圈加号，点了才让对方回复 --- */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom:has(.input-box-custom:not(:placeholder-shown)) .send-btn-custom {
  display: flex !important;
  align-items: center !important;
  justify-content: center !important;
  position: absolute !important;
  right: var(--wxb-side) !important;
  bottom: calc(var(--wxb-bottom) + (var(--wxb-cap-h) - var(--wxb-send-h)) / 2) !important;
  left: auto !important;
  top: auto !important;
  z-index: 4 !important;
  box-sizing: border-box !important;
  width: var(--wxb-send-w) !important;
  height: var(--wxb-send-h) !important;
  min-width: var(--wxb-send-w) !important;
  min-height: var(--wxb-send-h) !important;
  max-width: var(--wxb-send-w) !important;
  max-height: var(--wxb-send-h) !important;
  margin: 0 !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
  border: none !important;
  border-radius: var(--wxb-send-radius) !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  transform: none !important;
  opacity: 1 !important;
  visibility: visible !important;
  pointer-events: auto !important;
  background: var(--wxb-send-bg) !important;
  font-size: 0 !important;
  color: transparent !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom .send-btn-custom > * {
  display: none !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom:has(.input-box-custom:not(:placeholder-shown)) .send-btn-custom::before {
  content: none !important;
  display: none !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom:has(.input-box-custom:not(:placeholder-shown)) .send-btn-custom::after {
  content: var(--wxb-send-text) !important;
  display: block !important;
  position: static !important;
  width: auto !important;
  height: auto !important;
  margin: 0 !important;
  background: none !important;
  border: none !important;
  font-size: var(--wxb-send-size) !important;
  font-weight: 500 !important;
  line-height: 1 !important;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px !important;
  color: #FFFFFF !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #FFFFFF !important;
  white-space: nowrap !important;
  pointer-events: none !important;
}
/* 圆圈加号藏起来 */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom:has(.input-box-custom:not(:placeholder-shown)) .input-btn-ai.input-btn-ai {
  visibility: hidden !important;
  pointer-events: none !important;
}
/* 表情包：有字时也显示，往左让出发送键的位置 */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom:has(.input-box-custom:not(:placeholder-shown)) .input-btn-sticker.input-btn-sticker {
  display: block !important;
  visibility: visible !important;
  opacity: 1 !important;
  pointer-events: auto !important;
  right: calc(var(--wxb-side) + var(--wxb-send-w) + var(--wxb-gap2)) !important;
}
/* 打字时 App 可能是把表情包外面那层藏了（透明 / 缩成 0），这里把那几层也撑开 */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom:has(.input-box-custom:not(:placeholder-shown)) *:has(.input-btn-sticker) {
  visibility: visible !important;
  opacity: 1 !important;
  transform: none !important;
  filter: none !important;
  clip-path: none !important;
  overflow: visible !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom:has(.input-box-custom:not(:placeholder-shown)) .input-btn-sticker.input-btn-sticker {
  width: var(--wxb-icon) !important;
  height: var(--wxb-icon) !important;
  transform: none !important;
  clip-path: none !important;
  background-image: var(--wxb-ic-sticker) !important;
}
/* 假的表情包图标：打字时 App 把真按钮删了，用底栏的 ::before 画一个一样的
   只是图，点了没反应；把字删光真的按钮就回来了
   （::before 平时是「可按住 转文字」，有字时本来就不显示，这里借来用） */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom:has(.input-box-custom:not(:placeholder-shown))::before {
  content: "" !important;
  display: block !important;
  position: absolute !important;
  left: auto !important;
  right: calc(var(--wxb-side) + var(--wxb-send-w) + var(--wxb-gap2)) !important;
  top: auto !important;
  bottom: calc(var(--wxb-bottom) + (var(--wxb-cap-h) - var(--wxb-icon)) / 2) !important;
  width: var(--wxb-icon) !important;
  height: var(--wxb-icon) !important;
  margin: 0 !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
  background: var(--wxb-ic-sticker) center / 100% 100% no-repeat !important;
  border: none !important;
  font-size: 0 !important;
  transform: none !important;
  pointer-events: none !important;
  z-index: 2 !important;
}
/* 输入框跟着变短 */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom:has(.input-box-custom:not(:placeholder-shown)) *:has(> .input-box-custom) {
  margin-right: calc(var(--wxb-gap) + var(--wxb-icon) + var(--wxb-gap2) + var(--wxb-send-w)) !important;
}
/* ◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆ 【气泡】 ◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆ */
/* 微信气泡：无描边，圆角 5px，侧边一个小三角尖角
   我方 #94ED6C，对方 #FFFFFF，文字都是黑色
   没有描边，所以尖角只用 ::before 画一层；::after 关掉
   图片、视频、表情包、各种卡片：不套气泡，也不长尖角 */

/* --- 1. 气泡本体 --- */
div.chat-detail-screen :is(.bubble-me-custom, .msg-plain-me, .bubble-them-custom, .msg-plain-them) {
  position: relative !important;
  overflow: visible !important;
  color: var(--wx-bubble-text) !important;
  border: none !important;
  border-radius: var(--wx-bubble-radius) !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  text-shadow: none !important;
  backdrop-filter: none !important;
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: none !important;
  font-size: var(--wx-font) !important;
  line-height: 1.45 !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen :is(.bubble-me-custom, .msg-plain-me) {
  background: var(--wx-me-bg) !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen :is(.bubble-them-custom, .msg-plain-them) {
  background: var(--wx-them-bg) !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen :is(.bubble-me-custom, .msg-plain-me, .bubble-them-custom, .msg-plain-them) * {
  color: var(--wx-bubble-text) !important;
  text-shadow: none !important;
  font-size: var(--wx-font) !important;
}

/* --- 头像：38px 小圆角方形
   !important 能压住 App 写在行内的尺寸 --- */
div.chat-detail-screen :is(.msg-avatar-them-container, .msg-avatar-me-container) {
  flex: none !important;
  width: var(--wx-avatar) !important;
  min-width: var(--wx-avatar) !important;
  max-width: var(--wx-avatar) !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen :is(.msg-avatar-them-inner, .msg-avatar-me-inner, .msg-avatar-custom),
div.chat-detail-screen :is(.msg-avatar-them-container, .msg-avatar-me-container) img {
  width: var(--wx-avatar) !important;
  height: var(--wx-avatar) !important;
  min-width: var(--wx-avatar) !important;
  min-height: var(--wx-avatar) !important;
  max-width: var(--wx-avatar) !important;
  max-height: var(--wx-avatar) !important;
  border-radius: var(--wx-avatar-radius) !important;
  object-fit: cover !important;
}

/* --- 2. 尖角（公共）：转 45° 的小方块，尖端带一点圆
   中心点 = 头像高度的一半，所以永远对着头像正中 --- */
div.chat-detail-screen :is(.bubble-me-custom, .msg-plain-me, .bubble-them-custom, .msg-plain-them)::before {
  content: "" !important;
  display: block !important;
  position: absolute !important;
  top: calc(var(--wx-avatar) / 2 - var(--wx-tail) / 2 + var(--wx-tail-nudge)) !important;
  bottom: auto !important;
  width: var(--wx-tail) !important;
  height: var(--wx-tail) !important;
  border: none !important;
  border-radius: var(--wx-tail-round) !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  transform: rotate(45deg) !important;
  pointer-events: none !important;
  z-index: 0 !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen :is(.bubble-me-custom, .msg-plain-me, .bubble-them-custom, .msg-plain-them)::after {
  content: none !important;
  display: none !important;
}

/* 我方：右侧，尖角朝右 */
div.chat-detail-screen :is(.bubble-me-custom, .msg-plain-me)::before {
  right: calc(-1 * var(--wx-tail) / 2) !important;
  left: auto !important;
  background: var(--wx-me-bg) !important;
}
/* 对方：左侧，尖角朝左 */
div.chat-detail-screen :is(.bubble-them-custom, .msg-plain-them)::before {
  left: calc(-1 * var(--wx-tail) / 2) !important;
  right: auto !important;
  background: var(--wx-them-bg) !important;
}

/* 清掉 bubble-deco 上的旧尾巴 */
div.chat-detail-screen :is(.bubble-deco-me, .bubble-deco-them)::before,
div.chat-detail-screen :is(.bubble-deco-me, .bubble-deco-them)::after {
  content: none !important;
  display: none !important;
}

/* --- 3. 非文字消息：去掉气泡底色和尖角 ---
   带引用的文字消息、通话记录卡照样保留气泡 */
div.chat-detail-screen :is(.bubble-me-custom, .msg-plain-me, .bubble-them-custom, .msg-plain-them):has(img, video, [class*="card"], [class*="sticker"]):not(:has(.msg-reply-block, .msg-videocall-card, .voice-msg)) {
  background: transparent !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen :is(.bubble-me-custom, .msg-plain-me, .bubble-them-custom, .msg-plain-them):has(img, video, [class*="card"], [class*="sticker"]):not(:has(.msg-reply-block, .msg-videocall-card, .voice-msg))::before {
  content: none !important;
  display: none !important;
}

/* --- 4. 间距：同一个人连着发挨近一点，换人说话时拉开
   照 水茉 的写法：App 在每一行上自己写了上下边距和内边距，先全部清零，再统一给
   :not(#_k) 叠三层是为了压过 App 写在行内的边距，不要删 --- */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k):not(#_k) .msg-bubble-wrapper {
  margin-top: 0 !important;
  margin-bottom: var(--wx-gap-same) !important;
  padding-top: 0 !important;
  padding-bottom: 0 !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k):not(#_k) .msg-bubble-wrapper:is(.is-last, .is-single) {
  margin-bottom: var(--wx-gap-group) !important;
}
/* 这一条下面挂着引用框时：下一条再往上收 --wx-quote-pull（引用框本身已经隔开了） */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k):not(#_k):not(#_k) .msg-bubble-wrapper:has(.msg-reply-block-detached) {
  margin-bottom: max(0px, calc(var(--wx-gap-same) - var(--wx-quote-pull))) !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k):not(#_k):not(#_k) .msg-bubble-wrapper:is(.is-last, .is-single):has(.msg-reply-block-detached) {
  margin-bottom: max(0px, calc(var(--wx-gap-group) - var(--wx-quote-pull))) !important;
}

/* ◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆ 【气泡间距 + 语音】 ◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆ */
/* 文字气泡和语音气泡用同一套内边距，单行时一样高（≈ 头像高度）
   语音：只留「4"」和声波图标，图标用 SVG 画
     我方：时长在左、图标在右，声波朝左
     对方：图标在左、时长在右，声波朝右
   语音条长短照样跟着时长变 */

/* --- 1. 气泡内边距统一（图片、卡片那些后面会再清成 0） --- */
div.chat-detail-screen :is(.bubble-me-custom, .msg-plain-me, .bubble-them-custom, .msg-plain-them) {
  box-sizing: border-box !important;
  padding: var(--wx-pad-y) var(--wx-pad-x) !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen :is(.bubble-me-custom, .msg-plain-me, .bubble-them-custom, .msg-plain-them):has(img, video, [class*="card"], [class*="sticker"]):not(:has(.msg-reply-block, .msg-videocall-card, .voice-msg)) {
  padding: 0 !important;
}

/* --- 2. 所有气泡离头像远一点：挪气泡那一列，不动头像 --- */
div.chat-detail-screen .msg-them .msg-content-stack {
  margin-left: var(--wx-avatar-gap) !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen .msg-me .msg-content-stack {
  margin-right: var(--wx-avatar-gap) !important;
}

/* --- 3. 语音：照 qq灰 的做法
   外层气泡壳透明，绿 / 白底和尖角画在语音条（.voice-controls-row）上
   「转文字」按钮变透明，铺在语音条上面，点语音条就展开 / 收起
   转出来的文字是语音条下面单独一个气泡 --- */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) :is(.bubble-me-custom, .msg-plain-me, .bubble-them-custom, .msg-plain-them):has(.voice-msg) {
  padding: 0 !important;
  background: transparent !important;
  border: none !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) :is(.bubble-me-custom, .msg-plain-me, .bubble-them-custom, .msg-plain-them):has(.voice-msg)::before,
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k) :is(.bubble-me-custom, .msg-plain-me, .bubble-them-custom, .msg-plain-them):has(.voice-msg)::after {
  content: none !important;
  display: none !important;
}

/* 语音容器：竖排，语音条在上、转文字在下 */
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg {
  --voice-download-display: none !important;
  --voice-toggle-display: block !important;
  display: flex !important;
  flex-direction: column !important;
  gap: 0 !important;
  position: relative !important;
  overflow: visible !important;
  margin: 0 !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
  background: transparent !important;
  border: none !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  color: var(--wx-voice-ink) !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg-me   { align-items: flex-end !important; }
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg-them { align-items: flex-start !important; }

/* 语音条本体 = 看得见的气泡 */
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg .voice-controls-row {
  display: flex !important;
  align-items: center !important;
  justify-content: flex-start !important;
  gap: var(--wx-voice-gap) !important;
  position: relative !important;
  overflow: visible !important;
  box-sizing: content-box !important;
  width: auto !important;
  min-width: calc(var(--voice-len-base) - var(--wx-pad-x) * 2) !important;
  height: calc(var(--wx-font) * 1.45) !important;
  min-height: 0 !important;
  margin: 0 !important;
  padding: var(--wx-pad-y) var(--wx-pad-x) !important;
  border: none !important;
  border-radius: var(--wx-bubble-radius) !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg-me .voice-controls-row {
  background: var(--wx-me-bg) !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg-them .voice-controls-row {
  background: var(--wx-them-bg) !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg .voice-controls-row::before {
  content: none !important;
  display: none !important;
}

/* 语音条的尖角：和文字气泡同一个，对着头像中间 */
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg .voice-controls-row::after {
  content: "" !important;
  display: block !important;
  position: absolute !important;
  top: calc(var(--wx-avatar) / 2 - var(--wx-tail) / 2 + var(--wx-tail-nudge)) !important;
  bottom: auto !important;
  width: var(--wx-tail) !important;
  height: var(--wx-tail) !important;
  border: none !important;
  border-radius: var(--wx-tail-round) !important;
  transform: rotate(45deg) !important;
  pointer-events: none !important;
  z-index: 0 !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg-me .voice-controls-row::after {
  right: calc(-1 * var(--wx-tail) / 2) !important;
  left: auto !important;
  background: var(--wx-me-bg) !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg-them .voice-controls-row::after {
  left: calc(-1 * var(--wx-tail) / 2) !important;
  right: auto !important;
  background: var(--wx-them-bg) !important;
}

/* 波形藏起来，只当空白撑长度 */
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg .voice-waveform {
  flex: 1 1 0 !important;
  width: 0 !important;
  min-width: 0 !important;
  height: 0 !important;
  min-height: 0 !important;
  overflow: hidden !important;
  visibility: hidden !important;
}

/* 播放键 → 声波图标，压在透明点击层上面，点它是播放 */
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg .voice-play-btn {
  position: relative !important;
  z-index: 6 !important;
  flex: none !important;
  width: var(--wx-voice-icon) !important;
  height: var(--wx-voice-icon) !important;
  min-width: var(--wx-voice-icon) !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
  margin: 0 !important;
  border: none !important;
  border-radius: 0 !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  opacity: 1 !important;
  background-color: transparent !important;
  background-position: center !important;
  background-size: contain !important;
  background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
  -webkit-mask-image: none !important;
  mask-image: none !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg .voice-play-btn > * {
  display: none !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg-me .voice-play-btn {
  background-image: var(--wx-voice-me-icon) !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg-them .voice-play-btn {
  background-image: var(--wx-voice-them-icon) !important;
}

/* 时长 */
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg .voice-duration {
  flex: none !important;
  margin: 0 !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
  min-width: 0 !important;
  width: auto !important;
  font-size: var(--wx-font) !important;
  font-weight: 400 !important;
  line-height: 1 !important;
  white-space: nowrap !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg :is(.voice-duration, .voice-duration *) {
  color: var(--wx-voice-ink) !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: var(--wx-voice-ink) !important;
}

/* 我方：[空白] 0:04 图标　对方：图标 0:08 [空白] */
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg-me .voice-waveform   { order: 0 !important; }
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg-me .voice-duration   { order: 1 !important; }
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg-me .voice-play-btn   { order: 2 !important; }
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg-them .voice-play-btn { order: 0 !important; }
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg-them .voice-duration { order: 1 !important; }
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg-them .voice-waveform { order: 2 !important; }

/* 下载、重试、报错这些键不要 */
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg .voice-download-btn,
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-controls-row .voice-retry-btn,
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-controls-row .voice-error-btn,
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-controls-row button:not(.voice-play-btn) {
  display: none !important;
}

/* 「隐藏文字 / 转文字」按钮：看不见，铺在语音条上，点语音条就展开 / 收起 */
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg .voice-transcription-toggle {
  display: block !important;
  position: absolute !important;
  top: 0 !important;
  width: 100% !important;
  height: calc(var(--wx-font) * 1.45 + var(--wx-pad-y) * 2) !important;
  margin: 0 !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
  background: none !important;
  border: none !important;
  opacity: 0 !important;
  z-index: 5 !important;
  pointer-events: auto !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg-me .voice-transcription-toggle   { right: 0 !important; left: auto !important; }
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg-them .voice-transcription-toggle { left: 0 !important; right: auto !important; }

/* 转出来的文字：语音条下面单独一个气泡，颜色跟发送方一样 */
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg .voice-transcription {
  display: block !important;
  position: relative !important;
  top: auto !important;
  left: auto !important;
  right: auto !important;
  box-sizing: border-box !important;
  width: fit-content !important;
  max-width: 100% !important;
  margin: var(--wx-tr-gap) 0 0 !important;
  padding: var(--wx-pad-y) var(--wx-pad-x) !important;
  border: none !important;
  border-radius: var(--wx-bubble-radius) !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  font-size: var(--wx-font) !important;
  line-height: 1.45 !important;
  white-space: pre-wrap !important;
  word-break: break-word !important;
  z-index: 1 !important;
  animation: none !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg-me .voice-transcription {
  background: var(--wx-tr-me-bg) !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg-them .voice-transcription {
  background: var(--wx-tr-them-bg) !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg .voice-transcription,
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg .voice-transcription * {
  color: var(--wx-bubble-text) !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: var(--wx-bubble-text) !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg .voice-transcription::before,
div.chat-detail-screen .voice-msg .voice-transcription::after {
  content: none !important;
  display: none !important;
}

/* ◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆ 【功能菜单点不动 · 修复】 ◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆ */
/* 照 tim蓝 的修法
   原因：底栏 position: relative + z-index: 40，自己成了一层，
        菜单在底栏里面，z-index 再高到了整页也只有 40；
        App 弹菜单时铺的那层透明遮罩比 40 高，手指点到的是遮罩
   修法：菜单打开时，把底栏和菜单外面每一层都抬到 9999；
        毛玻璃挪到底栏的 ::after 垫层上（写在底栏本身会让菜单定位跑偏）
   :not(#_k) 叠三层是为了压过上面底栏的规则，不要删 */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom {
  background: transparent !important;
  backdrop-filter: none !important;
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: none !important;
  isolation: isolate !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom::after {
  content: "" !important;
  display: block !important;
  position: absolute !important;
  inset: 0 !important;
  margin: 0 !important;
  border: none !important;
  border-radius: 0 !important;
  background: var(--wxb-bg) !important;
  backdrop-filter: blur(var(--wxb-blur)) saturate(1.8) !important;
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(var(--wxb-blur)) saturate(1.8) !important;
  pointer-events: none !important;
  z-index: -1 !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k):not(#_k) .input-area-custom:has(.more-options-popup),
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k):not(#_k) *:has(.more-options-popup),
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k):not(#_k) .more-options-popup {
  z-index: 9999 !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k):not(#_k) .more-options-popup,
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k):not(#_k) .more-options-popup * {
  pointer-events: auto !important;
  visibility: visible !important;
}
/* ◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆ 【引用 · 气泡下方独立引用条】 ◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆ */
/* 仿微信：引用不塞在气泡里，是气泡下面单独一个小框
   白底 + 细边框 #e3e3e3 + 小圆角，灰字
   - 文字：名字和正文连在一起，最多两行，超出「…」
   - 表情包 / 图片：「名字：」在左上，缩略图在右边
   用的是 App 的 .msg-reply-block-detached（气泡外那份），气泡里那份藏掉
   :not(#_k) 叠三层是为了压过 App 自带样式，不要删 */

/* --- 1. 气泡里那份藏掉，气泡外那份打开 --- */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k):not(#_k):not(#_k) .msg-reply-block {
  display: none !important;
}
